.TH OMNI-CONFIG 1 "August 2026" "omni-term-ai" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
omni-config \- choose the shell AI assistants shown in the Command Center
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B omni-config
.RI [ command ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Selects which shell AI assistants ("harnesses") launch in the two top panes
of the Omni Term AI Command Center window.
The top-left pane and the top-right pane can each run any harness, including
the same harness twice.
.PP
Configuration is stored in a file of literal assignments that
.BR launch-ai-workspace (1)
reads at startup (it is not sourced):
.IR $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/omni-term-ai/config
(default:
.IR ~/.config/omni-term-ai/config ).
It contains assignments for the panes and for jumpbox, FIM, and Azure:
.IP
OMNI_LEFT_HARNESS=agy
.IP
OMNI_RIGHT_HARNESS=grok
.IP
OMNI_JUMPBOX=user@host
.IP
OMNI_FIM_ENGINE=native
.IP
OMNI_FIM_PROVIDER=deepseek
.IP
OMNI_AZURE_ENDPOINT=https://example.openai.azure.com
.IP
OMNI_AZURE_DEPLOYMENT=my-deployment
.PP
Supported harnesses:
.TP
.B grok
xAI Grok Build. Install:
.BR "curl -fsSL https://x.ai/cli/install.sh | bash" .
Auth: browser sign-in or
.BR XAI_API_KEY .
.TP
.B agy
Google Antigravity. Install:
.BR "curl -fsSL https://antigravity.google/cli/install.sh | bash" .
Auth: Google sign-in (optional
.BR GEMINI_API_KEY ).
.TP
.B copilot
GitHub Copilot CLI. Install:
.BR "brew install copilot-cli" .
Auth:
.B /login
or
.BR GH_TOKEN .
.TP
.B claude
Claude Code. Install:
.BR "npm install -g @anthropic-ai/claude-code" .
Auth:
.B "claude /login"
or
.BR ANTHROPIC_API_KEY .
.TP
.B codex
OpenAI Codex. Install:
.BR "npm install -g @openai/codex" .
Auth:
.B "codex login"
or
.BR OPENAI_API_KEY .
.TP
.B deepseek
DeepSeek Harness. Install:
.BR "npm install -g @deepseek-ai/dsh" .
Auth:
.BR DEEPSEEK_API_KEY .
The DeepSeek key also powers Fill-In-The-Middle completion in the Neovim
Editor window (see
.BR launch-ai-workspace (1)).
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B omni-config
With no arguments, runs an interactive wizard that writes both harness
choices.
.TP
.B omni-config list
Lists every supported harness with its installed status and, for missing
binaries, the install command.
.TP
.B omni-config get [left|right|jumpbox|fim|fim-provider|azure-endpoint|azure-deployment]
Prints the current selection. With no side, prints the panes plus jumpbox,
FIM engine, FIM provider, and Azure endpoint and deployment.
.TP
.B omni-config set <side> <value>
Writes one setting.
.B left
and
.B right
take a harness name.
.B jumpbox
takes
.B user@host
or
.B none .
.B fim
takes
.BR native ,
.BR copilot ,
or
.BR none .
.B fim-provider
takes
.BR deepseek ,
.BR openai ,
or
.BR azure .
.B azure-endpoint
and
.B azure-deployment
take the Azure OpenAI URL and deployment name.
Unknown names fail.
.TP
.B omni-config path
Prints the config file path.
.SH FILES
.I $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/omni-term-ai/config
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR launch-ai-workspace (1),
.BR omni-secret (1),
.BR omni-exec (1),
.BR tmux (1)
